Subject: [PATCH] [mlir][SPIRV] Preserve scalar storage for WebGPU aliases
Upstream: https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/239584 (open)
Commit: 18f800a9f753cc4d91264b3a4390ae4ce310ae7d
LLVM 23 API adaptation: getDiscardableAttrOfType -> getAttrOfType.

diff --git a/mlir/lib/Dialect/SPIRV/Transforms/UnifyAliasedResourcePass.cpp b/mlir/lib/Dialect/SPIRV/Transforms/UnifyAliasedResourcePass.cpp
